| description = '''Note:''' Some newer quests may refer to this faction as Coalition of Tradefolk Underground. It was originally called Coalition of Tradefolk Illegal (shortened to Coalition of Tradefolk ILL). 

In [[East Freeport]] hidden beneath the docks under the Seafarer's Roost, is an entrance to the passages holding the Rogues Guild called Coalition of Tradefolk, Illegal.  These Rogues under Guildmaster [[Elisi Nasin]] walk the dangerous edge of Neutrality. Care should be taken visiting them, as they are not far from the evil guild called the [[Dismal Rage]].  Their activities support the [[Coalition of Tradefolk]], who are the merchants of Freeport, and [[Carson McCabe]] the Leader of [[High Keep]].  In addition they support the [[Corrupt Qeynos Guards]] and the [[Freeport Militia]], who are also quite corrupt.  If one does not stand upon principals, helping this guild can raise your standing in some of the darker elements of society without lowering your standing with the forces of good.

